WEBVTT

01:49.580 --> 01:54.940
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.039 --> 01:58.000
[Episode 38]

01:58.210 --> 02:01.780
[21:00 to 19:00]

02:37.430 --> 02:38.280
Shangguan He.

02:38.630 --> 02:39.560
Shangguan He.

02:39.680 --> 02:40.870
From now on, any man you choose

02:40.870 --> 02:42.270
must not be worse than me.

02:43.600 --> 02:46.400
As ordered by the Junior General,
the Qianyu Army...

02:46.400 --> 02:47.120
Rong Hua,

02:47.120 --> 02:47.750
save me!

02:47.750 --> 02:48.360
I’ll count to three.

02:48.360 --> 02:49.270
Chu Guihong.

02:49.430 --> 02:50.470
What are you trying to do?

02:50.470 --> 02:52.210
I'm here to serve His Majesty.

02:52.310 --> 02:53.120
Song Yimeng.

02:53.120 --> 02:53.910
Come down.

02:54.430 --> 02:55.329
I don't believe in fate,

02:55.329 --> 02:56.460
so you're not allowed to believe either.

02:56.460 --> 02:57.710
Today, on the city tower...

02:57.310 --> 02:59.010
[Suzhang Gate]

02:57.710 --> 02:59.310
If we don't finish the either-or choice,

02:59.040 --> 03:00.460
[17:00]

02:59.310 --> 03:00.800
nothing will end.

03:00.550 --> 03:02.210
[16:00]

03:00.800 --> 03:01.470
It's the Crown Princess.

03:01.470 --> 03:02.470
She went to the Qianyu Mansion.

03:02.280 --> 03:09.710
[15:00 to 13:00]

03:02.470 --> 03:03.470
There are other rules

03:03.470 --> 03:04.470
related to Nan Heng's disease

03:04.470 --> 03:06.190
Bless my daughter's marriage.

03:06.190 --> 03:08.470
I'm afraid Father can't make it this time.

03:08.470 --> 03:09.470
I killed Jixiang..

03:09.470 --> 03:10.680
I killed Father.

03:09.790 --> 03:13.390
[11:30]

03:10.680 --> 03:11.910
Chu Guihong can’t be trusted.

03:11.910 --> 03:12.680
Your Highness.

03:12.680 --> 03:14.080
Go find the Crown Prince.

03:13.450 --> 03:21.079
[11:00]

03:14.080 --> 03:15.750
The 18th Prince poisoned His Majesty.

03:15.750 --> 03:17.750
So i though of buying some red tangerines

03:17.750 --> 03:18.840
to comfort Father.

03:18.870 --> 03:19.630
Rong Hua.

03:19.630 --> 03:20.430
I can't trust anyone

03:20.430 --> 03:21.630
except you.

03:21.160 --> 03:28.960
[9:00]

03:21.680 --> 03:22.840
It's windy again.

03:22.840 --> 03:24.560
Where did the moth come from?

03:24.680 --> 03:25.310
That’s right.

03:25.310 --> 03:26.630
Chu Guihong secretly deployed
hidden troops

03:26.630 --> 03:28.690
from the borderlands to the capital.

03:29.079 --> 03:33.820
[Huaipu Hall]

03:34.579 --> 03:38.329
[Six hours ago at 9 p.m.]

03:39.630 --> 03:40.450
Song Yimeng.

03:40.840 --> 03:41.630
Song Yimeng.

03:59.980 --> 04:01.370
What happened?

04:03.430 --> 04:04.730
Am I dead

04:05.470 --> 04:06.680
or have I returned?

04:13.630 --> 04:14.580
Nan Heng.

04:15.320 --> 04:18.779
[Good Virtues]

04:20.279 --> 04:21.160
Nan Heng.

04:22.310 --> 04:23.120
Nan Heng.

04:28.120 --> 04:28.920
Nan Heng!

04:30.830 --> 04:31.850
Nan Heng.

04:35.240 --> 04:36.040
Nan Heng!

04:37.270 --> 04:38.290
Nan Heng!

04:39.270 --> 04:40.600
Are you there, Nan Heng?

04:41.950 --> 04:46.820
[Huaipu Hall]

04:48.560 --> 04:49.240
Nan Heng.

04:51.000 --> 04:51.800
Nan Heng!

04:52.360 --> 04:53.000
Nan Heng!

05:17.050 --> 05:19.820
♪ No words can cage
a heart full of wounds ♪

05:20.570 --> 05:23.000
♪ I shake the heavens and plains
through the storm ♪

05:23.980 --> 05:27.190
♪ A promise is made,
and I don't fear death anymore ♪

05:28.130 --> 05:29.010
Nan Heng.

05:28.200 --> 05:30.640
♪ Even dreams are pleasant ♪

05:31.570 --> 05:34.120
♪ Is it obsession, or chosen pain? ♪

05:32.350 --> 05:33.420
It's really you.

05:35.000 --> 05:39.280
♪ Is it pride, with no shame? ♪

05:39.650 --> 05:40.750
Nan Heng.

05:39.990 --> 05:43.510
♪ To give you a love
etched into the bones ♪

05:40.990 --> 05:42.720
That's great, Nan Heng.

05:43.180 --> 05:44.720
You're not dead.

05:44.600 --> 05:45.460
♪ Then it's not something to
grieve over ♪

05:44.720 --> 05:46.630
You're really still alive.

05:46.880 --> 05:51.100
♪ If tears are proof that I once loved ♪

05:47.050 --> 05:49.950
I thought I'd never see you again.

05:53.680 --> 05:59.490
♪ If what's gone leaves behind
a trace of being ♪

05:53.950 --> 05:54.850
What's wrong?

05:54.920 --> 05:56.159
What happened?

06:00.270 --> 06:01.070
What happened?

06:00.990 --> 06:02.790
♪ Then let the tears fall ♪

06:01.480 --> 06:02.120
You...

06:02.120 --> 06:03.160
Who bullied you?

06:03.520 --> 06:05.290
♪ Let me love you ♪

06:06.040 --> 06:11.780
♪ And fade away with one last dream ♪

06:06.270 --> 06:07.540
No one bullied me.

06:09.270 --> 06:10.070
Nan Heng.

06:10.720 --> 06:12.230
I really came back.

06:12.680 --> 06:14.010
And you're still alive.

06:15.540 --> 06:16.490
That's great.

06:16.520 --> 06:17.560
What do you mean I'm still alive

06:17.560 --> 06:18.870
Aren’t I living just fine?

06:18.870 --> 06:19.830
What happened?

06:21.760 --> 06:22.920
You liar!

06:23.040 --> 06:25.240
You're already sick to a serious point.

06:25.240 --> 06:27.040
You still want to hide it from me?

06:27.430 --> 06:28.360
Are you trying to bear

06:28.360 --> 06:30.160
the weight of everything alone?

06:31.160 --> 06:31.920
What do you mean?

06:31.920 --> 06:32.720
Nothing.

06:33.070 --> 06:34.040
I'm fine.

06:34.040 --> 06:35.600
You're still not being honest.

06:35.600 --> 06:37.000
You’re already this sick,

06:37.000 --> 06:38.070
and you still won’t tell me?

06:38.070 --> 06:38.830
Fine.

06:38.830 --> 06:39.630
FIne.

06:39.760 --> 06:40.800
Okay, okay.

06:41.480 --> 06:42.270
Chief.

06:46.720 --> 06:49.070
Aren’t we supposed to discuss
about the Lord Qianyu?

06:49.070 --> 06:50.510
What are you two doing

06:50.510 --> 06:51.430
in the morning?

06:59.070 --> 07:00.480
I have something important

07:00.480 --> 07:01.480
to tell you both.

07:02.480 --> 07:04.650
I already knew everything.

07:04.750 --> 07:05.560
Besides,

07:07.070 --> 07:08.750
I died with you both once.

07:13.040 --> 07:14.000
Later,

07:14.040 --> 07:16.360
send someone to kidnap Song Yiting
and her daughter

07:16.360 --> 07:18.420
That way, only will Song Yimeng obey.

07:18.480 --> 07:19.340
Also,

07:19.630 --> 07:20.870
make proper arrangements

07:20.870 --> 07:22.670
for the Emperor's poisoning.

07:23.480 --> 07:24.990
Song Yimeng alone

07:25.480 --> 07:27.430
is not enough to threaten Nan Heng.

07:29.270 --> 07:30.680
Did you hear me?

07:30.680 --> 07:32.810
It'll be too late if you don't do it now.

07:41.270 --> 07:42.070
Got it.

07:43.010 --> 07:44.480
Once the incident happens,

07:44.480 --> 07:47.080
I will enter the palace
to protect the emperor.

07:52.430 --> 07:54.240
You must listen to me this time.

07:54.240 --> 07:55.680
Don't act on your own.

07:56.240 --> 07:57.270
Everything today

07:57.390 --> 07:59.950
is to set into motion
the either-or selection at the city tower.

07:59.950 --> 08:02.270
Only when the iconic scenes happen
as planned,

08:02.270 --> 08:03.480
can I return to modern times

08:03.480 --> 08:05.480
and arrange the best ending for you.

08:12.680 --> 08:14.280
Where did the moth come from?

08:15.770 --> 08:17.320
It's windy again.

08:18.920 --> 08:19.720
Everything

08:21.380 --> 08:23.090
has only just begun.

08:26.680 --> 08:28.690
So Chu Guihong and Lord Qianyu

08:28.750 --> 08:30.080
are not on the same side.

08:31.340 --> 08:32.799
The purpose of Lord Qianyu

08:32.870 --> 08:35.669
is to return to the modern era
after completing the iconic scenes.

08:35.669 --> 08:37.130
Chu Guihong

08:37.630 --> 08:39.630
seems to be willing to cooperate.

08:39.669 --> 08:40.600
But in fact,

08:40.750 --> 08:42.480
he wanted to poison His Majesty

08:42.510 --> 08:43.440
and frame you.

08:45.840 --> 08:48.080
Then he can justify

08:48.080 --> 08:50.320
under the guise of eliminating the rebels

08:50.320 --> 08:51.720
to send troops to kill you

08:51.840 --> 08:52.840
at the city tower.

08:54.220 --> 08:55.130
Kill him?

08:56.390 --> 08:57.650
What comes after that?

08:58.360 --> 08:59.150
After that,

08:59.960 --> 09:01.690
of course he usurped the throne

09:01.750 --> 09:03.550
and become the emperor himself.

09:08.270 --> 09:09.730
Why are you nodding?

09:09.840 --> 09:10.630
She just woke up.

09:10.630 --> 09:11.840
Can you believe her?

09:11.960 --> 09:12.750
Mrs. Li,

09:13.200 --> 09:13.960
I think

09:13.960 --> 09:14.960
you must've been too exhausted recently

09:14.960 --> 09:16.290
and had a strange dream.

09:16.510 --> 09:17.390
I trust her.

09:20.320 --> 09:21.180
Think about it.

09:21.670 --> 09:23.320
Even this whole world is painted,

09:23.320 --> 09:24.720
what else is impossible?

09:28.270 --> 09:29.510
Is there any other clues

09:29.510 --> 09:31.310
in this round of reincarnation?

09:33.630 --> 09:35.550
Actually, I've been through
a reincarnation

09:35.550 --> 09:36.840
when I first came here.

09:37.480 --> 09:38.630
At that time,

09:39.000 --> 09:40.790
I wanted to marry Chu Guihong

09:41.670 --> 09:43.270
and the script says

09:43.270 --> 09:45.800
I would definitely run away
from the wedding.

09:45.960 --> 09:46.870
So later,

09:47.330 --> 09:49.270
no matter how hard I tried
to change the plot,

09:49.270 --> 09:50.800
my life ends in a tragic way.

09:52.670 --> 09:53.870
Why can't I untie it?

09:53.870 --> 09:54.600
Time to roll!

10:00.250 --> 10:01.180
My Lady.

10:04.790 --> 10:05.630
My Lady!

10:05.630 --> 10:08.610
I don't want to be in this world anymore.

10:09.550 --> 10:12.000
It seems that the reincarnation

10:12.550 --> 10:14.210
was triggered again this time

10:14.670 --> 10:15.550
because I died.

10:18.440 --> 10:19.860
You mean

10:19.960 --> 10:21.240
as long as you die,

10:21.240 --> 10:22.790
we can come back to this moment?

10:22.790 --> 10:23.600
That's right.

10:25.030 --> 10:25.720
Then,

10:25.720 --> 10:27.910
how can the Chu family fight against us?

10:27.910 --> 10:28.870
If the situation is going south,

10:28.870 --> 10:30.520
you can just kill yourself.

10:31.870 --> 10:33.640
You have a point.

10:33.840 --> 10:35.670
If anything happens,

10:36.440 --> 10:37.550
I'll die again.

10:37.840 --> 10:39.200
What do you mean have a point?

10:39.200 --> 10:40.860
What if something goes wrong?

10:40.870 --> 10:41.670
Don't worry.

10:41.870 --> 10:42.790
I've experienced it.

10:42.790 --> 10:43.550
Nothing will go wrong.

10:43.550 --> 10:44.460
That won't do.

10:44.670 --> 10:46.080
What if the reincarnation fails?

10:46.080 --> 10:48.270
Or if there’s a twist
in the cycle of reincarnation?

10:48.270 --> 10:49.080
Listen.

10:49.080 --> 10:51.030
I won't let you risk your life.

10:51.030 --> 10:51.720
Nan Heng.

10:52.030 --> 10:53.670
It's really different this time.

10:53.670 --> 10:55.480
Only I can

10:55.480 --> 10:57.030
give everyone a chance to start over.

10:57.030 --> 10:59.030
Who else can take the risk if I don't?

10:59.080 --> 11:00.750
You are the key to
the either-or selection at the city tower.

11:00.750 --> 11:02.390
As long as you don't appear
on the city tower,

11:02.390 --> 11:04.590
they won't be able to complete the plan.

11:05.120 --> 11:05.910
But...

11:06.480 --> 11:07.480
But I can't just watch you all...

11:07.480 --> 11:08.360
Listen to me.

11:09.000 --> 11:09.790
Listen to me.

11:10.030 --> 11:11.550
You told us everything

11:11.550 --> 11:12.610
and that's enough.

11:12.670 --> 11:13.840
Leave the rest to us.

11:14.440 --> 11:15.240
Later,

11:15.670 --> 11:17.840
I’ll ask Fugui to protect you.

11:18.320 --> 11:20.450
Before I could control the Chu family,

11:20.480 --> 11:21.740
you can't go anywhere.

11:21.750 --> 11:22.440
Nan Heng.

11:22.440 --> 11:23.120
Be good.

11:24.870 --> 11:25.670
If Lord Qianyu needs

11:25.670 --> 11:27.790
the either-or selection
at the city tower to happen,

11:27.790 --> 11:29.790
he will definitely target Song Yiting

11:29.790 --> 11:30.600
I think

11:31.030 --> 11:32.840
they will take action outside the city.

11:32.840 --> 11:33.630
Sure.

11:33.870 --> 11:34.870
I save my person.

11:34.870 --> 11:36.080
You guard your person.

11:36.080 --> 11:37.550
I'll leave the palace to you.

11:37.550 --> 11:39.080
Remember to bring more men.

11:39.320 --> 11:40.240
Don't forget,

11:40.510 --> 11:42.240
she said you died before me.

11:43.440 --> 11:44.390
This time,

11:44.550 --> 11:46.000
I'll die behind you.

11:46.090 --> 11:51.100
[Soaring Spirits]

11:51.390 --> 11:52.200
Nan Heng.

11:52.630 --> 11:54.500
I know I can't go with you.

11:54.550 --> 11:56.080
It'll cause trouble if I do.

11:56.330 --> 11:57.640
But you must promise me

11:57.670 --> 11:58.790
to be careful

11:58.790 --> 12:00.190
and to protect yourself.

12:00.200 --> 12:01.000
Okay?

12:01.750 --> 12:02.550
Don't worry.

12:05.480 --> 12:08.440
Okay.

12:05.570 --> 12:15.730
[10:00]

12:09.670 --> 12:10.270
Here you go.

12:10.270 --> 12:10.870
Okay.

12:10.870 --> 12:11.480
Here.

12:13.200 --> 12:14.260
Let's go, Jixiang.

12:14.440 --> 12:15.770
Let's enter the palace.

12:28.490 --> 12:29.280
Sir.

12:37.660 --> 12:42.400
[Qianyu Mansion]

12:42.670 --> 12:43.510
General.

12:43.720 --> 12:44.810
I've completed

12:44.840 --> 12:46.370
the tasks you ordered me to.

12:46.480 --> 12:47.380
But

12:47.600 --> 12:48.480
our men

12:48.750 --> 12:50.480
have just received a word from the spy

12:50.480 --> 12:52.150
that Nan Heng went to His Majesty's place

12:52.150 --> 12:53.830
early this morning.

12:54.120 --> 12:55.360
And the guards in the palace

12:55.360 --> 12:56.560
have been increased.

13:00.280 --> 13:01.680
Something must be wrong.

13:02.900 --> 13:04.600
What about Song Yiting and her mother?

13:04.600 --> 13:05.670
Our men

13:05.670 --> 13:07.470
have been keeping an eye on them.

13:09.510 --> 13:10.320
Okay.

13:11.360 --> 13:13.020
I know what to do in the palace.

13:13.310 --> 13:15.270
Take action sooner
on Song Yiting's matter.

13:15.270 --> 13:16.070
Yes.

13:23.150 --> 13:24.060
Rong Hua.

13:24.910 --> 13:26.240
I no longer trust anyone

13:26.240 --> 13:27.360
except you.

13:28.320 --> 13:29.120
Remember,

13:29.550 --> 13:31.080
when Lord Qianyu gives instructions,

13:31.080 --> 13:32.470
follow through as much as you can.

13:32.470 --> 13:33.270
But

13:33.990 --> 13:36.390
you don't have to listen to him
completely.

13:39.790 --> 13:41.520
[11:00]

13:41.540 --> 13:44.100
[Imperial Study]

13:45.320 --> 13:46.020
Your Majesty.

13:46.020 --> 13:47.750
The Eighteenth Prince is here.

13:48.240 --> 13:49.320
Let him in.

13:49.350 --> 13:50.150
Yes.

13:55.090 --> 13:55.880
Father.

13:55.910 --> 13:56.720
Father

13:55.950 --> 14:01.770
[Playing at 2x speed]

13:56.720 --> 13:57.600
I heard that Heng is sick.

13:57.600 --> 13:58.200
You must be very sad.

13:58.200 --> 13:59.150
Now that Father is upset
because of Heng's illness.

13:59.150 --> 13:59.790
I thought of buying Father
some red tangerines,

13:59.790 --> 14:00.320
hoping that this will make you
feel better.

14:00.320 --> 14:00.600
Rui, you've grown up.

14:00.600 --> 14:01.360
You’ve finally learned to care about me.

14:01.360 --> 14:01.630
Here.

14:01.630 --> 14:02.290
Have a seat.

14:04.360 --> 14:04.950
Father.

14:05.080 --> 14:06.840
Let me peel a tangerine for you.

14:06.840 --> 14:07.480
Okay.

14:11.600 --> 14:12.390
Father.

14:12.870 --> 14:14.360
You're a grown adult now

14:14.360 --> 14:16.600
and you can't even peel a tangerine well.

14:16.600 --> 14:17.200
Um...

14:17.300 --> 14:19.010
When Mother was still alive,

14:19.090 --> 14:20.960
she used to peel them for me.

14:21.190 --> 14:22.420
And I've also never

14:22.510 --> 14:24.240
peeled tangerines for anyone.

14:33.870 --> 14:35.270
You clumsy kid.

14:36.320 --> 14:37.120
Let me do it.

14:38.670 --> 14:39.390
Okay.

14:50.120 --> 14:51.580
Father, you have it first.

14:54.360 --> 14:55.160
Your Majesty.

14:55.170 --> 14:56.090
Your Highness.

14:56.150 --> 14:57.030
Your Highness.

14:57.820 --> 14:58.980
Have you recovered?

15:01.410 --> 15:02.870
This is highly poisonous.

15:03.840 --> 15:04.480
Wait.

15:04.870 --> 15:05.670
Hang.

15:05.720 --> 15:07.170
Are you out of your mind?

15:07.430 --> 15:08.870
I specially bought these red tangerines,

15:08.870 --> 15:09.960
worried that Father might be
in low spirits.

15:09.960 --> 15:11.480
How could you frame me for poisoning?

15:11.480 --> 15:12.000
You...

15:12.000 --> 15:12.910
You saddened me.

15:12.910 --> 15:14.710
When did I say you poisoned them?

15:14.870 --> 15:16.870
It's Chu Guihong who poisoned them.

15:18.600 --> 15:19.400
Let me ask you.

15:20.080 --> 15:21.480
Where did this come from?

15:22.240 --> 15:23.120
I...

15:23.120 --> 15:25.080
I bought it at the South City market.

15:25.080 --> 15:26.820
Did you meet anyone on the way?

15:27.270 --> 15:28.080
Yesterday,

15:28.270 --> 15:29.080
I...

15:30.390 --> 15:31.600
I met Rong Hua.

15:32.750 --> 15:33.680
Rong Hua?

15:34.750 --> 15:35.670
That's it.

15:36.360 --> 15:38.510
Her Majesty's death anniversary
is around the corner.

15:38.510 --> 15:39.370
Red tangerines from Dongting

15:39.370 --> 15:42.120
were Her Majesty's favourite food
when she was still alive.

15:42.120 --> 15:43.320
Every year at this time,

15:43.320 --> 15:45.840
Rui will have red tangerines
with Your Majesty

15:45.840 --> 15:46.750
as memorial.

15:47.630 --> 15:49.510
Not many people in the palace
know about this.

15:49.510 --> 15:51.580
But Chu Guihong is one of them.

15:52.000 --> 15:53.000
So,

15:53.080 --> 15:55.210
I guess he must have bribed the vendors

15:55.480 --> 15:56.840
and poisoned the tangerines

15:56.840 --> 15:58.170
to poison Your Majesty.

15:58.670 --> 15:59.600
Impossible.

15:59.600 --> 16:01.240
No matter how bold Guihong is,

16:01.240 --> 16:02.750
he wouldn't dare to kill His Majesty.

16:02.750 --> 16:04.480
If he really wanted to kill someone,

16:04.480 --> 16:05.910
he will kill you first.

16:06.720 --> 16:07.670
You're right.

16:07.870 --> 16:09.240
He doesn't plan the lives

16:09.240 --> 16:10.750
of all three of us.

16:12.200 --> 16:12.870
Heng

16:13.670 --> 16:14.590
I'm afraid

16:14.960 --> 16:16.550
this is just your guess.

16:17.720 --> 16:18.790
Let me ask you.

16:18.960 --> 16:19.960
Do you have proof?

16:20.870 --> 16:21.670
Your Majesty,

16:22.480 --> 16:24.030
you can ask someone
from the royal medical office to test

16:24.030 --> 16:24.960
and you'll know if it's true.

16:24.960 --> 16:25.270
No.

16:25.270 --> 16:26.270
What's the need of doing that?

16:26.270 --> 16:27.000
Heng.

16:27.320 --> 16:28.480
If you don't believe me,

16:28.480 --> 16:29.480
I'll have it myself now

16:29.480 --> 16:31.340
and let you see if it's poisonous.

16:31.840 --> 16:32.750
I trust you.

16:35.630 --> 16:36.560
Liu Mingxi.

16:36.960 --> 16:39.270
send someone from the royal medical office
to test for poison.

16:39.270 --> 16:40.080
Yes.

16:42.510 --> 16:43.120
Heng.

16:43.960 --> 16:45.420
Send your men to South City

16:46.030 --> 16:47.080
and send the vendor involved

16:47.080 --> 16:48.630
to the prison of the Ministry of Justice

16:48.630 --> 16:49.830
and hand him to Yan Yi.

16:51.030 --> 16:51.580
Yes.

16:53.000 --> 16:53.440
Your Majesty.

16:53.440 --> 16:54.640
I have one more thing.

16:54.840 --> 16:55.630
Go ahead.

16:56.080 --> 16:57.340
I beg Your Majesty

16:57.670 --> 16:59.870
to deploy the troops in the outskirts
back to the city

16:59.870 --> 17:01.620
and send the Xuanjia Army
back to the capital as soon as possible

17:01.620 --> 17:03.050
in case of emergency.

17:05.480 --> 17:06.170
What...

17:07.880 --> 17:10.349
What's happening today?

17:11.569 --> 17:16.190
[Capital]

17:24.030 --> 17:24.960
Junior General,

17:25.310 --> 17:26.440
as you expected,

17:26.440 --> 17:28.030
After Nan Heng entered
His Majesty's bed chamber,

17:28.030 --> 17:29.070
His Majesty and the 18th Prince

17:29.070 --> 17:30.310
didn't eat the poisoned food.

17:30.310 --> 17:31.110
Not only that,

17:31.110 --> 17:33.070
His Majesty also deployed the Xuanjia Army
to the capital.

17:32.940 --> 17:36.360
[Capital]

17:34.080 --> 17:35.510
Deploy troops to the capital?

17:35.510 --> 17:36.730
Is the news true?

17:36.880 --> 17:37.680
Yes.

17:37.770 --> 17:40.430
The eunuch we planted in the bed chamber
said so.

17:41.070 --> 17:42.350
What about the vendor selling red tangerines?

17:42.350 --> 17:44.280
Did you send him out of the capital?

17:46.070 --> 17:47.220
We were too late.

17:47.030 --> 17:53.300
[Capital]

17:47.270 --> 17:48.680
By the time you asked me to rush there,

17:48.680 --> 17:51.010
he was just taken away
by the Xuanjia Army.

17:52.350 --> 17:53.280
Junior General,

17:53.680 --> 17:54.480
now,

17:54.480 --> 17:55.740
what should we do next?

17:55.790 --> 17:56.550
That vendor

17:56.550 --> 17:57.880
won't be able to stand severe torture

17:57.880 --> 17:58.980
and will give us away.

17:58.980 --> 18:03.270
[Capital]

17:59.480 --> 18:00.480
At that time,

18:00.640 --> 18:02.030
if we were to be sentenced to death
for treason,

18:02.030 --> 18:02.440
then...

18:02.440 --> 18:03.370
So what about it?

18:04.200 --> 18:06.260
Since he's pushing me to the dead end,

18:06.510 --> 18:08.030
I won't go easy on him.

18:09.400 --> 18:10.640
Tell Rong Hua

18:10.670 --> 18:11.920
to act in advance.

18:12.070 --> 18:12.680
Yes.

18:24.850 --> 18:26.070
The wound is two inches deep,

18:26.070 --> 18:27.290
caused by a Qianyu Sword.

18:27.290 --> 18:30.890
I'm afraid Mrs. Shangguan
has been taken away by the Qianyu Army.

18:36.960 --> 18:38.070
The footprints went that way.

18:38.070 --> 18:39.200
Seems like they just left not long ago.

18:39.200 --> 18:39.480
Go after them!

18:39.480 --> 18:40.340
Second Master.

18:40.350 --> 18:41.240
The situation have changed.

18:41.240 --> 18:43.040
Should we report to Chief first?

18:43.680 --> 18:45.160
Chief is still in the palace.

18:45.160 --> 18:46.720
We definitely don't have enough time
to go back and forth.

18:46.720 --> 18:47.920
Now that we are all here,

18:47.920 --> 18:48.550
save the people first.

18:48.550 --> 18:49.000
Let's go.

18:49.000 --> 18:49.510
Go.

18:49.530 --> 18:50.160
Go.

19:03.880 --> 19:04.740
Second Master.

19:08.880 --> 19:09.940
Yiting's hairpin.

19:10.310 --> 19:11.110
Second Master.

19:11.110 --> 19:12.310
There’s one here too.

19:15.270 --> 19:16.310
Second Master.

19:20.480 --> 19:21.340
Second Master.

19:21.640 --> 19:22.440
Do you think

19:22.440 --> 19:24.110
Mrs. Shangguan left this here on purpose

19:24.110 --> 19:25.370
so that we can find her?

19:29.160 --> 19:30.420
It could also be a trap.

19:30.550 --> 19:32.070
Shall we chase after them?

19:33.270 --> 19:33.830
Let's go.

19:34.140 --> 19:35.180
Let's go inside.

19:37.240 --> 19:38.230
Mrs. Shangguan.

19:38.680 --> 19:39.710
Mrs. Shangguan.

19:39.880 --> 19:40.730
Yiting.

19:42.270 --> 19:43.370
Mrs. Shangguan.

19:47.010 --> 19:48.000
Yiting.

19:50.050 --> 19:51.100
Mrs. Shangguan.

19:53.160 --> 19:54.210
Mrs. Shangguan.

19:55.660 --> 19:56.780
Mrs. Shangguan.

19:57.750 --> 19:58.720
Run!

19:58.830 --> 20:00.550
Run! Quick! Run!

20:00.550 --> 20:01.590
Run! Hurry!

20:04.430 --> 20:05.690
Shangguan He!

20:07.120 --> 20:08.650
Chu Guihong, are you crazy?

20:08.680 --> 20:10.810
What grudge does you have against him?

20:11.400 --> 20:12.200
Why?

20:13.640 --> 20:14.750
Is it painfu

20:14.960 --> 20:16.370
watching the person you love die

20:16.370 --> 20:18.420
in front of you

20:19.070 --> 20:20.670
while you can't do anything?

20:23.200 --> 20:24.130
Yiting.

20:25.270 --> 20:27.090
You bastard!

20:27.950 --> 20:28.640
Yiting.

20:28.640 --> 20:29.810
I've already tasted this

20:29.810 --> 20:32.030
in the Pingrong Battle.

20:32.310 --> 20:34.070
My father was killed by Nan Heng.

20:34.070 --> 20:36.330
Why can't I kill one of his subordinates?

20:36.960 --> 20:38.430
Let go of me!

20:38.560 --> 20:40.340
Guihong, listen to me.

20:40.680 --> 20:41.830
The person you hate

20:41.830 --> 20:43.220
should be Nan Heng, right?

20:43.220 --> 20:45.050
It shouldn't be us.

20:45.350 --> 20:46.350
Yiting and I

20:46.350 --> 20:48.070
have never wronged you.

20:48.240 --> 20:49.270
I beg you.

20:49.830 --> 20:51.070
Let Yiting go.

20:51.310 --> 20:52.750
No matter what's your plan
against Nan Heng,

20:52.750 --> 20:53.920
I can help you.

20:53.920 --> 20:55.550
Can’t I help you?

21:00.880 --> 21:02.280
You don't have to do this.

21:03.950 --> 21:06.250
We insignificant people

21:06.480 --> 21:08.140
should be helping each other.

21:15.840 --> 21:16.880
Mother!

21:18.350 --> 21:19.200
Let go of me!

21:19.270 --> 21:20.320
Let go of me!

21:20.440 --> 21:21.030
Mother!

21:21.030 --> 21:21.510
Yiting.

21:21.510 --> 21:22.270
Overestimating yourself.

21:22.270 --> 21:23.070
Yiting.

21:23.960 --> 21:24.920
Tell me,

21:25.960 --> 21:27.510
how do you feel

21:28.330 --> 21:30.060
watching Shangguan He die?

21:33.830 --> 21:34.640
Tell me.

21:37.070 --> 21:39.870
I want to eat you and drink your blood

21:40.370 --> 21:42.160
to vent my hatred.

21:42.160 --> 21:43.380
Yiting.

21:46.160 --> 21:47.240
That's right.

21:48.110 --> 21:49.400
Only humans have love

21:49.420 --> 21:50.340
and hatred.

21:51.270 --> 21:52.270
Only humans have discontent

21:52.270 --> 21:53.720
and the urge to change their fate.

21:53.720 --> 21:56.340
No one is born to be a sidekick
for others.

21:57.270 --> 21:59.190
Every pain I went through

21:59.350 --> 22:02.550
has become Nan Heng's stepping stone
towards his ending.

22:02.720 --> 22:03.850
I can't accept this.

22:03.860 --> 22:05.000
Cut the crap.

22:05.480 --> 22:07.100
Kill me if you want.

22:07.270 --> 22:08.790
Don't let me survive.

22:08.790 --> 22:10.400
I will make you pay for it.

22:13.940 --> 22:15.320
I won't kill you,

22:15.650 --> 22:17.380
I only want you to do me a favour.

22:18.300 --> 22:20.160
Yimeng is not as excellent as you,

22:20.390 --> 22:22.520
but she is treated better than you are.

22:22.640 --> 22:23.880
All these years,

22:24.070 --> 22:26.810
I don't believe you have no discontent.

22:27.160 --> 22:28.960
As long as you help me ask her out,

22:30.310 --> 22:32.200
I'll give you a good ending.

22:35.350 --> 22:37.830
You want me to do evil for you?

22:39.270 --> 22:40.350
Dream on!

22:40.350 --> 22:41.240
Yiting.

22:52.310 --> 22:53.350
Yiting!

23:01.830 --> 23:02.680
Yiting.

23:02.720 --> 23:03.680
Why don't you

23:04.310 --> 23:06.070
give this to Yimeng for me?

23:07.550 --> 23:08.950
Tell her I want to see her.

23:11.960 --> 23:13.720
But she has to come alone.

23:17.610 --> 23:18.670
[14:00]

23:18.700 --> 23:21.050
[Qianyu Mansion]

23:24.160 --> 23:25.020
Your Highness.

23:25.590 --> 23:26.790
I just received the imperial edict

23:26.790 --> 23:28.030
to come and capture Chu and his son.

23:28.030 --> 23:29.400
Why did you arrive first?

23:29.400 --> 23:30.750
Your Highness came late.

23:30.750 --> 23:31.640
Lord Qianyu

23:31.960 --> 23:32.750
is dead.

23:51.160 --> 23:52.830
He was strangled to death.

23:55.160 --> 23:56.260
Just as

23:56.680 --> 23:59.440
the palace spread word about
arresting the Chu family,

23:59.440 --> 24:01.770
the Lord Qianyu died the very next moment.

24:02.320 --> 24:04.330
Chu Guihong has also gone missing.

24:04.920 --> 24:06.240
What a coincidence.

24:07.240 --> 24:08.830
Except Chu Guihong,

24:09.270 --> 24:10.400
who else could it be?

24:11.680 --> 24:12.880
Chu Guihong

24:13.680 --> 24:15.790
still has the power to deploy troops.

24:16.350 --> 24:18.080
He must be planning something.

24:21.480 --> 24:22.310
Immediate lead some men

24:22.310 --> 24:23.880
to search for Chu Guihong.

24:23.820 --> 24:25.750
[Full of Vigor]

24:23.960 --> 24:24.750
Yes.

24:25.070 --> 24:25.880
Let's go.

24:29.540 --> 24:31.680
[Righteousness]

24:29.680 --> 24:30.540
Your Highness.

24:30.790 --> 24:31.510
Your Highness.

24:31.510 --> 24:33.200
An explosion broke out in a cave
in the woods outside the city.

24:33.200 --> 24:33.920
Nightwalker

24:33.920 --> 24:34.930
was in the cave.

24:37.170 --> 24:41.420
[Jize Palace]

24:47.160 --> 24:49.020
Fugui, let me in.

24:49.240 --> 24:51.000
I must see Eldest today.

24:51.110 --> 24:52.000
Mrs. Song,

24:52.000 --> 24:54.030
let me report to the Crown Princess first.

24:54.030 --> 24:55.240
There's no time.

24:55.240 --> 24:56.230
Step aside.

24:56.440 --> 24:57.240
Fugui.

24:57.790 --> 25:01.930
[Huaipu Hall]

24:58.400 --> 24:59.070
Yimeng.

24:59.070 --> 24:59.790
Madam.

25:00.130 --> 25:01.210
What happened?

25:01.240 --> 25:02.000
Yimeng.

25:02.070 --> 25:03.200
Please save Yiting.

25:03.200 --> 25:04.200
Save Yiting.

25:05.110 --> 25:06.510
What happened to Yiting?

25:06.550 --> 25:07.550
That bastard, Chu Guihong,

25:07.550 --> 25:09.050
took Yiting away.

25:09.270 --> 25:10.070
And

25:10.720 --> 25:13.440
he even cut one of Yiting's fingers.

25:18.270 --> 25:20.530
I've only cut one of her fingers now,

25:20.590 --> 25:23.420
but whether Song Yiting comes out alive
or dead

25:23.440 --> 25:24.650
is up to you.

25:25.720 --> 25:27.110
It still happened.

25:28.110 --> 25:29.000
Where is Miss Yiting?

25:29.000 --> 25:29.880
I'll go and save her now.

25:29.880 --> 25:30.590
No.

25:31.070 --> 25:31.880
Yimeng.

25:33.270 --> 25:34.270
Madam, please get up.

25:34.270 --> 25:34.720
Yimeng.

25:34.720 --> 25:35.480
Get up and talk.

25:35.480 --> 25:36.240
Yimeng.

25:36.440 --> 25:37.830
I beg you.

25:38.070 --> 25:39.180
Chu Guihong said,

25:39.270 --> 25:41.030
you have to go to Song Residence,

25:41.030 --> 25:43.430
only will he let Yiting go.

25:43.480 --> 25:45.620
You have to go alone.

25:50.030 --> 25:51.020
I know.

25:51.160 --> 25:52.160
I have

25:52.160 --> 25:54.070
done you wrong many times in the past.

25:54.070 --> 25:54.880
But

25:54.880 --> 25:56.540
you can't leave Yiting alone.

25:57.110 --> 25:58.110
I beg you.

25:58.110 --> 25:59.310
I beg you, please.

25:59.310 --> 26:00.030
Yiming.

26:00.030 --> 26:00.720
Madam.

26:00.720 --> 26:01.830
No need to speak further.

26:01.830 --> 26:02.400
Let's go.

26:02.400 --> 26:03.240
Take me there.

26:03.240 --> 26:04.190
Okay.

26:04.240 --> 26:06.750
[Light and Blessings]

26:04.350 --> 26:05.160
You can't go.

26:05.920 --> 26:06.780
Your Highness.

26:07.030 --> 26:08.880
I’ll deal with Chu Guihong.

26:09.000 --> 26:10.030
I’ll bring some soldiers

26:10.030 --> 26:11.480
to rescue Miss Yiting.

26:12.270 --> 26:12.960
No

26:12.980 --> 26:13.670
No.

26:13.720 --> 26:15.000
He asked me to go alone.

26:15.070 --> 26:16.110
If he can't see me,

26:16.110 --> 26:17.030
he won't give up.

26:17.030 --> 26:17.510
Yes.

26:17.510 --> 26:18.350
You can't go.

26:18.640 --> 26:20.070
His Highness commanded

26:20.090 --> 26:21.950
that you can't leave the mansion.

26:22.880 --> 26:23.680
Fugui.

26:24.240 --> 26:25.830
If Nan Heng is in trouble today,

26:25.830 --> 26:26.830
will you ignore it?

26:26.830 --> 26:27.510
Um...

26:27.720 --> 26:29.310
How can you mix the two?

26:29.400 --> 26:31.070
I am His Highness' subordinate.

26:31.070 --> 26:32.400
My life belongs to His Highness.

26:32.400 --> 26:33.510
You are different.

26:33.550 --> 26:34.790
You are His Highness's partner.

26:34.790 --> 26:36.110
But Yiting is my family.

26:36.110 --> 26:37.440
I must save her.

26:40.920 --> 26:41.400
Then...

26:41.830 --> 26:42.730
You have to

26:42.920 --> 26:44.250
report to His Highness.

26:45.750 --> 26:46.810
He's ill.

26:47.000 --> 26:48.110
Don't tell him yet.

26:48.830 --> 26:49.810
Don't worry.

26:49.920 --> 26:51.520
They won't do anything to me.

26:51.570 --> 26:52.050
Then...

26:52.750 --> 26:54.110
Let me lead some troops

26:54.310 --> 26:55.170
and follow you.

26:59.640 --> 27:01.350
The Song Residence will definitely

27:01.350 --> 27:02.400
be surrounded by Qianyu Army.

27:02.400 --> 27:04.330
You can't show up at the front door.

27:04.350 --> 27:05.680
There's a patch of untamed grass

27:05.680 --> 27:07.030
one li from the back door of
the Song Residence.

27:06.400 --> 27:10.610
[15:00]

27:07.030 --> 27:08.090
You can wait there.

27:11.440 --> 27:12.640
If the Crown Princess hasn't come out

27:12.640 --> 27:13.880
after two hours,

27:13.880 --> 27:15.000
I will go in

27:15.000 --> 27:16.960
and fight Chu Guihong to death.

27:23.940 --> 27:24.640
Please.

27:32.600 --> 27:39.510
[Iconic Scenes in the Script]

27:46.040 --> 27:53.090
[Slacker Escape Plan]

27:49.480 --> 27:50.270
Chu Guihong.

27:50.830 --> 27:51.760
Where's Yiting?

27:52.070 --> 27:53.680
And the rest of the Song family,

27:53.680 --> 27:54.550
where are they?

27:56.940 --> 27:59.220
[7. Turned into a human swine
in the Cold Palace]

27:57.590 --> 27:59.070
It was right near this spot

27:59.750 --> 28:01.240
that he struck me down,

28:02.200 --> 28:03.000
wasn't it?

28:07.440 --> 28:08.030
Yes.

28:09.350 --> 28:10.110
But

28:11.640 --> 28:12.880
that was the old script.

28:12.880 --> 28:14.000
And soon,

28:14.720 --> 28:16.450
you will die by his hands still.

28:19.920 --> 28:20.790
In that case,

28:26.770 --> 28:27.600
Song Yimeng,

28:29.720 --> 28:31.120
why do you still help him?

28:33.440 --> 28:34.440
Because he's no longer

28:34.440 --> 28:36.030
the Nan Heng he used to be.

28:38.270 --> 28:39.070
Chu Guihong.

28:40.440 --> 28:41.700
I came to see you today,

28:42.550 --> 28:45.410
other than because my family
is still in your hands,

28:46.440 --> 28:48.570
I also want to advise you one last time.

28:49.070 --> 28:50.440
Like you, Nan Heng and I

28:51.110 --> 28:52.310
hate the script

28:52.550 --> 28:54.750
that has control over everyone's fate.

28:56.270 --> 28:57.680
What we're doing now

28:57.960 --> 28:58.960
is exactly trying our best

28:58.960 --> 29:00.550
to change our fates,

29:01.270 --> 29:02.590
including that of the Song family,

29:02.590 --> 29:03.540
all the people

29:04.000 --> 29:05.200
of the Waning River Crescent

29:05.200 --> 29:06.030
and you.

29:09.810 --> 29:11.680
If you can let go of your obsession,

29:11.680 --> 29:12.740
in this vast world,

29:12.740 --> 29:14.220
you can

29:14.480 --> 29:15.880
establish achievements

29:15.920 --> 29:17.070
and conquer the battlefield anywhere.

29:17.070 --> 29:18.880
You can even be a hero

29:18.880 --> 29:19.750
like your father.

29:19.750 --> 29:20.450
Enough.

29:22.830 --> 29:24.230
Why should I believe you?

29:24.440 --> 29:26.070
Why should I condescend myself

29:26.070 --> 29:29.000
and be Nan Heng's subordinate
for the rest of my life?

29:29.550 --> 29:31.310
I learned swordsmanship at six,

29:31.310 --> 29:32.590
and was stationed at the border at 17.

29:32.590 --> 29:34.160
My injuries are no less than Nan Heng

29:34.160 --> 29:37.110
and the amount of people I protected
are also no less than him.

29:37.110 --> 29:38.380
But in the end,

29:38.550 --> 29:40.270
just because he is the destined male lead,

29:40.270 --> 29:41.790
just because of
a few strokes from the puppeteer,

29:41.790 --> 29:43.200
I deserve to be trampled

29:43.200 --> 29:44.480
and die by his hands?

29:45.270 --> 29:46.070
Song Yimeng.

29:46.750 --> 29:47.510
Tell me.

29:47.510 --> 29:48.480
If you were me,

29:48.480 --> 29:49.210
wouldn't you

29:49.920 --> 29:50.790
fight back?

29:57.590 --> 29:59.010
Of course I will.

30:00.630 --> 30:02.290
But I won't be like you,

30:02.350 --> 30:03.920
hurting innocent lives

30:03.920 --> 30:05.920
to achieve your goal.

30:06.920 --> 30:08.470
Have you ever thought about it?

30:08.470 --> 30:10.180
For your own selfish desire,

30:10.240 --> 30:11.680
you made innocent people

30:11.680 --> 30:13.200
your sacrifice.

30:13.200 --> 30:15.060
Have you thought about all these?

30:17.240 --> 30:18.540
I'm also telling you,

30:19.200 --> 30:20.550
the one who caused your tragic fate

30:20.550 --> 30:21.800
wasn't Nan Heng,

30:22.400 --> 30:23.940
but the old script.

30:27.810 --> 30:29.050
You're right.

30:30.970 --> 30:31.880
The one at fault

30:31.880 --> 30:33.830
is that parasite inside my father.

30:37.360 --> 30:38.940
So I killed him.

30:44.240 --> 30:45.030
Why?

30:46.160 --> 30:47.330
Is it strange?

30:48.270 --> 30:50.070
Because Chu Guihong should be a patriot

30:50.070 --> 30:51.350
who never let others down,

30:51.350 --> 30:52.110
that's why

30:53.070 --> 30:54.400
I can't kill anyone?

31:00.880 --> 31:02.390
I should have known

31:03.640 --> 31:06.500
that you are no longer the Chu Guihong
you used to be.

31:07.730 --> 31:09.990
Then are you still the Song Yimeng I know?

31:10.690 --> 31:11.970
My Yimeng

31:12.220 --> 31:14.890
is the person who trusts me the most
in this world.

31:14.890 --> 31:17.010
She never stands against me

31:17.070 --> 31:19.230
and will never side my enemy.

31:36.860 --> 31:38.100
Song Xiaoyu.

31:39.020 --> 31:40.940
You don't have to say anything.

31:41.060 --> 31:42.380
I won't let you go

31:43.410 --> 31:45.120
before my plan succeeds.

31:45.860 --> 31:47.900
So you want to take me hostage

31:48.480 --> 31:49.740
and lure Nan Heng here?

31:50.270 --> 31:51.160
Let me tell you.

31:52.070 --> 31:53.350
Dream on.

31:54.000 --> 31:55.030
He won't come.

31:56.320 --> 31:57.400
You're right.

31:59.110 --> 32:00.310
But this

32:02.030 --> 32:02.830
is not enough.

32:20.400 --> 32:21.430
Come.

32:29.350 --> 32:30.420
Wake up.

32:30.960 --> 32:32.080
Wake up.

32:33.550 --> 32:34.410
Your Highness.

32:34.680 --> 32:35.480
I found them.

32:38.170 --> 32:38.770
Hurry.

32:40.350 --> 32:41.270
Give me a hand.

32:41.270 --> 32:41.920
Here.

32:48.350 --> 32:49.160
Yunlong.

32:49.510 --> 32:50.310
Yunlong.

32:50.850 --> 32:51.860
Yunlong!

32:52.720 --> 32:53.790
Get someone to save him.

32:53.790 --> 32:54.400
Yes.

32:55.680 --> 32:56.480
Here.

32:56.920 --> 32:57.720
Shangguan He.

32:58.070 --> 32:59.060
Shangguan He.

32:59.350 --> 33:00.160
Help!

33:01.200 --> 33:01.640
Come.

33:07.270 --> 33:08.000
Shanhu.

33:08.400 --> 33:09.070
Shanhu.

33:11.640 --> 33:12.610
Shanhu.

33:13.920 --> 33:14.850
Shanhu.

33:18.310 --> 33:18.830
Your Highness.

33:18.830 --> 33:19.310
Shanhu.

33:21.000 --> 33:22.060
His breath is weak.

33:22.830 --> 33:24.430
I'm afraid he can't survive.

33:31.550 --> 33:32.790
Don't forget.

33:33.000 --> 33:34.750
She said you will die before me.

33:35.960 --> 33:36.960
This time,

33:37.160 --> 33:38.550
I will die behind you.

33:44.250 --> 33:45.370
My condolences.

33:49.160 --> 33:50.220
What condolences?

33:51.270 --> 33:52.550
Get the imperial physician here!

33:52.550 --> 33:53.440
I want to save them.

33:53.440 --> 33:53.880
Yes.

33:54.160 --> 33:54.710
Yes.

33:59.300 --> 34:00.120
Shanhu.

34:00.190 --> 34:00.980
Shanhu!

34:01.830 --> 34:02.480
Shanhu.

34:03.270 --> 34:04.070
It's okay.

34:05.030 --> 34:05.830
Chief.

34:07.830 --> 34:08.610
Yes.

34:09.510 --> 34:11.590
Chu Guihong did it.

34:11.590 --> 34:12.280
Okay.

34:12.710 --> 34:13.540
Stop talking.

34:14.510 --> 34:15.400
Bring him out.

34:15.400 --> 34:16.190
Yes.

34:17.070 --> 34:17.880
Get up.

34:22.480 --> 34:23.340
Your Highness.

34:24.280 --> 34:26.080
Qianyu Army just sent this here.

34:31.440 --> 34:32.880
If you want to save Song Yimeng,

34:32.880 --> 34:34.030
come to the Song Residence

34:34.030 --> 34:35.280
alone.

35:04.880 --> 35:05.670
Yimeng.

35:05.670 --> 35:06.550
Father.

35:07.670 --> 35:08.760
Yiting.

35:09.400 --> 35:10.150
Madam.

35:11.670 --> 35:12.580
I'm sorry.

35:13.840 --> 35:15.070
I got you involved.

35:18.580 --> 35:19.540
Chu Guihong,

35:20.400 --> 35:22.150
Your target is me and Nan Heng.

35:22.360 --> 35:24.470
What grudge do you have
against the Song family?

35:24.470 --> 35:26.960
[Shining Stars and Moon]

35:24.900 --> 35:26.630
There was no grudge in the past.

35:27.710 --> 35:28.960
At that time,

35:29.280 --> 35:31.540
Mr. Song even treated me as a son-in-law.

35:31.570 --> 35:32.570
Song Yimeng.

35:33.030 --> 35:34.600
You changed first,

35:35.400 --> 35:36.440
not me.

35:37.000 --> 35:37.800
Your Highness.

35:37.800 --> 35:39.110
Don't listen to him.

35:39.110 --> 35:41.500
The Qianyu Army broke in first.

35:39.210 --> 35:41.320
[Xiyue Pavilion]

35:41.670 --> 35:43.350
Many people died.

35:43.510 --> 35:44.910
There were a lot of blood.

35:58.880 --> 35:59.700
Yinzhu!

36:01.710 --> 36:02.800
Chu Guihong, you bastard!

36:02.800 --> 36:03.190
Yiting

36:03.190 --> 36:04.590
Who are you to kill the innocent?

36:04.590 --> 36:05.400
Yiting.

36:05.550 --> 36:06.950
Stop it.

36:07.000 --> 36:08.190
She's just an ant.

36:08.920 --> 36:10.190
So what if I killed her.

36:12.510 --> 36:13.330
Song Yimeng.

36:14.590 --> 36:15.360
Listen.

36:16.500 --> 36:21.820
[Shining Stars and Moon]

36:16.760 --> 36:17.940
My sword

36:18.070 --> 36:19.590
has got a lot of blood on it.

36:20.360 --> 36:22.220
I don't mind killing more people.

36:22.710 --> 36:24.630
If you want to keep them alive,

36:25.920 --> 36:27.320
do as I say.

36:29.900 --> 36:31.540
What do you want me to do?

36:34.190 --> 36:36.920
I've sent someone to inform Nan Heng

36:36.920 --> 36:38.340
that you're at the Song Residence.

36:38.340 --> 36:40.040
I believe, soon,

36:40.150 --> 36:41.630
he will come here alone.

36:42.690 --> 36:45.910
I want you to persuade Nan Heng
to hand over the command token.

36:45.910 --> 36:47.390
I want to kill him.

36:48.360 --> 36:49.920
I want to ascend the throne.

36:56.420 --> 36:57.860
Wolfish greed.

36:57.930 --> 36:59.280
You're shameless!

37:05.710 --> 37:08.000
Yimeng, even if you don't think for yourself,

37:08.000 --> 37:09.590
you have to think about your father

37:09.590 --> 37:11.110
and your sister.

37:11.320 --> 37:12.920
As long as I get the command token,

37:12.920 --> 37:14.510
and as long as Nan Heng dies,

37:14.710 --> 37:15.630
I promise

37:16.000 --> 37:17.280
to send you and the Song family

37:17.280 --> 37:19.190
out of the capital

37:18.940 --> 37:24.510
♪ The mortal world entangles,
so much sorrow and chill in the mist ♪

37:19.400 --> 37:21.800
and keep you safe for the rest of your lives.

37:25.320 --> 37:26.400
Chu Guihong.

37:27.400 --> 37:29.400
The Chu family has been loyal for generations.

37:27.620 --> 37:33.250
♪ Our fates intertwine and weave
into a story ♪

37:29.540 --> 37:31.760
How did they raise such a rebel?

37:32.580 --> 37:34.020
[Xiyue Pavilion]

37:32.960 --> 37:33.760
Master.

37:34.400 --> 37:35.280
Stop it.

37:35.840 --> 37:37.640
You can't irritate him anymore.

37:36.250 --> 37:39.850
♪ Listening to the wind whispering
by my ear ♪

37:40.720 --> 37:43.600
♪ The schemes of the dark night ♪

37:44.580 --> 37:48.620
♪ Eyes guarding a single sunrise ♪

37:48.800 --> 37:49.590
Yimeng.

37:49.980 --> 37:52.900
♪ When will there be a way home? ♪

37:50.800 --> 37:51.880
I know

37:52.590 --> 37:54.210
I've let you down.

37:54.040 --> 37:57.200
♪ Time brings life and death, binding life
but not the heart ♪

37:55.000 --> 37:56.010
But,

37:56.480 --> 37:57.630
no matter what,

37:57.630 --> 37:58.890
I don't want anything

37:58.660 --> 38:01.980
♪ Stepping into the ranks of fate,
each pain a prelude ♪

37:59.360 --> 38:00.760
to happen tp you and Yiting

38:00.760 --> 38:02.800
I hope you can live, right?

38:02.800 --> 38:03.510
Shut up!

38:03.570 --> 38:07.100
♪ Transformed in a fleeting moment,
like a dream, elusive and near ♪

38:06.150 --> 38:07.890
As a Song, you must uphold your dignity.

38:07.890 --> 38:12.100
[Shining Stars and Moon]

38:08.090 --> 38:11.610
♪ How can love and hate be hidden? ♪

38:08.740 --> 38:11.740
The Song family has never raised a wretch.

38:12.510 --> 38:13.590
Betraying His Highness

38:12.630 --> 38:15.600
♪ Time brings life and death, binding life
but not the heart ♪

38:13.590 --> 38:15.190
to save my own life

38:15.590 --> 38:17.220
is not something I can do.

38:16.460 --> 38:20.550
♪ Making all moves in life cautiously,
joy and sorrow already destined ♪

38:17.440 --> 38:19.500
Yimeng is not allowed to do it either.

38:19.670 --> 38:20.880
Father is right.

38:21.320 --> 38:22.910
If Yimeng betrays her partner

38:22.200 --> 38:25.750
♪ If one dares oppose Heaven,
how can the ending be rewritten? ♪

38:23.000 --> 38:24.360
for her personal matters

38:24.360 --> 38:25.720
and the Song family,

38:26.280 --> 38:28.360
she won't be able
to live the rest of her life in peace.

38:26.810 --> 38:34.060
♪ So close yet still, we part ways ♪

38:29.030 --> 38:30.150
Instead,

38:31.190 --> 38:32.730
we'd better risk it all

38:32.960 --> 38:34.360
to fight against this bastard.

38:34.360 --> 38:35.250
Yiting.

38:35.920 --> 38:37.450
What are you talking about?

38:41.900 --> 38:47.440
[Shining Stars and Moon]

38:43.800 --> 38:45.510
What a touching act of

38:45.800 --> 38:48.530
father-daughter affection and
sisterly unity.

38:48.590 --> 38:51.450
You are so considerate for Song Yimeng
and Nan Heng.

38:51.710 --> 38:53.670
Why don't you open your eyes

38:54.320 --> 38:57.250
to properly examine if this person
you're caring for

38:58.600 --> 39:00.380
is the real Song Yimeng?

39:00.710 --> 39:01.670
So what?

39:02.230 --> 39:03.340
I only know

39:04.840 --> 39:06.440
she is someone who is willing

39:06.510 --> 39:08.240
to protect us with her own life.

39:09.590 --> 39:10.360
Yiting.

39:11.910 --> 39:15.420
♪ Time brings life and death, binding life
but not the heart ♪

39:12.710 --> 39:13.510
Father.

39:16.340 --> 39:19.800
♪ Stepping into the ranks of fate,
each pain a prelude ♪

39:17.400 --> 39:18.400
He is right.

39:20.360 --> 39:22.160
I am not Song Yimeng,

39:21.770 --> 39:25.310
♪ Transformed in a fleeting moment,
like a dream, elusive and near ♪

39:22.710 --> 39:23.510
but

39:26.280 --> 39:27.670
someone from another world.

39:26.410 --> 39:29.130
♪ How can love and hate be hidden? ♪

39:27.670 --> 39:28.870
Song Yimeng, shut up!

39:29.920 --> 39:31.590
You are my elder sister.

39:30.180 --> 39:33.920
♪ Time brings life and death, binding life
but not the heart ♪

39:32.150 --> 39:33.450
As long as you're here,

39:33.590 --> 39:35.000
you are my elder sister.

39:34.750 --> 39:38.580
♪ Making all moves in life cautiously,
joy and sorrow already destined ♪

39:36.000 --> 39:37.980
She is my daughter, Song Yimeng.

39:39.640 --> 39:43.180
♪ If one dares oppose Heaven,
how can the ending be rewritten? ♪

39:42.190 --> 39:43.000
Song Yimeng.

39:43.880 --> 39:45.110
The Song family treated you well.

39:44.000 --> 39:51.400
♪ So close yet still, we part ways ♪

39:45.760 --> 39:47.070
If you feel guilty,

39:47.150 --> 39:48.880
why don't you make a choice now.

39:49.110 --> 39:50.110
To protect the Song family

39:50.110 --> 39:51.510
and repay their kindness

39:51.960 --> 39:53.280
or save your family

39:54.030 --> 39:55.190
and choose Nan Heng?

39:59.630 --> 40:00.410
Father!

40:00.710 --> 40:01.510
Father!

40:01.510 --> 40:02.470
Honey!

40:05.590 --> 40:06.190
Father!

40:06.190 --> 40:06.760
Honey!

40:09.840 --> 40:10.630
Father!

40:15.550 --> 40:16.030
Father!

40:16.030 --> 40:16.920
Honey!

40:19.030 --> 40:19.840
Father!

40:20.150 --> 40:20.960
Father!

40:25.150 --> 40:26.400
Chu Guihong.

40:26.400 --> 40:27.890
You bastard!

40:30.840 --> 40:31.630
Father.

40:32.400 --> 40:33.210
Father.

40:33.230 --> 40:34.450
Yimeng.

40:35.400 --> 40:36.190
Father..

40:36.760 --> 40:39.670
You're still a crybaby like before.

40:43.070 --> 40:43.670
Father.

40:43.670 --> 40:44.400
I...

40:44.800 --> 40:46.670
can't protect you all.

40:48.590 --> 40:49.110
Father!

40:49.110 --> 40:49.960
Master!

40:49.960 --> 40:50.590
Father!

40:50.800 --> 40:51.890
Master!

40:52.030 --> 40:52.670
Father!

40:52.670 --> 40:54.400
Honey!

40:55.070 --> 40:56.400
Father!

40:56.630 --> 40:57.550
Honey!

40:57.550 --> 40:58.350
Father!

40:58.670 --> 40:59.670
Father!

41:00.400 --> 41:03.590
Honey!

41:03.590 --> 41:04.530
Father.

41:04.880 --> 41:11.370
[Shining Stars and Moon]

41:06.290 --> 41:07.420
You saw it yourself,

41:07.580 --> 41:09.000
he asked for it.

41:13.030 --> 41:13.670
Forget it.

41:14.190 --> 41:15.000
Song Yimeng.

41:15.020 --> 41:15.920
Honey...

41:15.920 --> 41:16.880
if you still want to save the lives

41:16.880 --> 41:18.630
of the rest of the Song family,

41:18.650 --> 41:20.030
do as I say.

41:24.310 --> 41:25.640
It's five o'clock now.

41:27.030 --> 41:28.630
Nan Heng should be here soon.

41:29.720 --> 41:30.040
[17:00]

41:30.060 --> 41:33.250
[Front Door of the Song residence]

41:33.380 --> 41:35.280
[Song Residence]

41:51.250 --> 41:52.540
[Back Door of the Song residence]

42:18.390 --> 42:19.540
Yiting.

42:20.590 --> 42:21.400
Madam.

42:22.890 --> 42:24.050
I'm sorry.

42:25.840 --> 42:27.770
Everything started because of me.

42:29.070 --> 42:31.030
I should end this.

42:32.000 --> 42:33.240
As long as I die,

42:33.270 --> 42:34.590
everything can start over.

42:34.590 --> 42:35.190
Song Yimeng.

42:35.190 --> 42:35.880
What are you doing?

42:35.880 --> 42:36.760
Yimeng!

43:00.760 --> 43:01.550
Nan Heng!

43:02.440 --> 43:03.320
Nan Heng!

43:08.670 --> 43:09.600
Nan Heng!

43:15.710 --> 43:17.350
Whenever the female lead is in danger,

43:17.350 --> 43:18.950
the male lead has to save her.

43:20.280 --> 43:21.400
If you want to die,

43:23.670 --> 43:25.510
I have to die before you.

43:32.990 --> 43:35.110
♪ Beyond my control, powerless to resist ♪

43:34.440 --> 43:35.370
Fool.

43:35.800 --> 43:38.380
♪ Yet still I dig deep, questioning fate ♪

43:39.440 --> 43:42.730
♪ That is the meaning
behind my defiance ♪

43:44.980 --> 43:47.450
♪ Is it obsession, or chosen pain? ♪

43:47.950 --> 43:49.040
Yimeng!

43:48.390 --> 43:52.310
♪ Is it pride, with no shame? ♪

43:53.290 --> 43:56.960
♪ To give you a love
etched into the bones ♪

43:57.910 --> 44:00.680
♪ Then it's not something to
grieve over ♪
